Privacy Policy

Last updated: 28/09/2026

Clean Kerala (“we”, “our”, or “us”) is committed to protecting the privacy of users who access and use our mobile application. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect information when you use the Clean Kerala app.

1. Information We Collect

We may collect the following information from users:

- Mobile number for login and OTP verification
- Name and profile details
- Email address, if provided
- Date of birth, if provided
- Assigned district, sector, ward, MCF, or local body details
- Collection, visit, pickup, and waste-related records entered through the app
- Device information required for secure login and authentication
- Uploaded images or documents, if the app feature requires them

2. How We Use the Information

The information collected is used for:

- User authentication and account access
- Managing waste collection activities
- Recording MCF visits, pickup details, and collection logs
- Displaying assigned wards, sectors, and local body information
- Generating reports and operational records
- Improving app performance, reliability, and user experience
- Preventing unauthorized access and misuse

3. OTP and Login

The app uses mobile number and OTP-based authentication. OTPs are used only to verify the identity of the user and allow secure access to the app.

4. Data Sharing

We do not sell, rent, or trade user data. Information may be shared only with authorized administrators, government/local body officials, or service teams for operational, reporting, technical, or legal purposes.

5. Data Storage and Security

We take reasonable measures to protect user data from unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or alteration. Some data may be stored locally on the device to improve app performance and user experience. Sensitive session information is cleared when the user logs out.

6. Location and Operational Data

The app may display or use ward, MCF, district, sector, or local body details assigned to the user. If location-based features are enabled in future versions, location data will be used only for app-related operational purposes.

7. User Responsibilities

Users are responsible for keeping their login access secure and should not share OTPs or account access with unauthorized persons.

8. Data Retention

We retain user and operational data only as long as required for app functionality, administrative records, reporting, legal compliance, or service improvement.

9. Children’s Privacy

This app is intended for authorized users and operational staff. It is not directed toward children.

10. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in the updated version of this policy.

